                "text": "\ud83d\udea8Senate Republicans are caving to Trump\u2019s pressure\u2014here\u2019s what their disastrous bill does: \n\n\u2611\ufe0f Slashes Medicaid and health coverage for almost 12 million people\n\u2611\ufe0f Adds nearly $4 trillion to our national debt\n\u2611\ufe0f Hands tax breaks to those who need it the least\n\u2611\ufe0f Does nothing to lower costs for working families \n\nIt\u2019s a giveaway to the top 0.01% \u2014on the backs of the majority of Americans.",
