                "text": "Before @BarackObama signed the ACA into law 13 years ago, many New Jerseyans had no access to affordable health insurance.\n\nNow, at least 75,000 New Jerseyans could lose their coverage if Republicans let ACA tax credits expire and healthcare would be more expensive for so many friends and neighbors across our state.  \n \n@HouseDemocrats are fighting every day to protect and extend this life-changing law for our communities. \n\nhttps://t.co/ZNWWzhu3NB",
